  i Variables read from process.env have no types, so misspelled or missing variables are only found when the code runs.
  
  i Declare the environment variables in convex/convex.config.ts, and read them from the env object exported by _generated/server.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  
